  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "掠蝦仔"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭若落山，暗頓差不多仝時tsūn煮好，兩媽孫仔做伙踮厝，thìng候tuì山頂番薯園作穡tńg--來ê阿公同齊食暗；洗tn̄g、phi衫tsiah煞，天就烏到伸手看無tsíng頭仔--ah；阿媽先tī門口埕點草絪來薰，suà--落-去攑蠓sut仔tī八跤眠床ê頭前、後壁puānn來puānn去，一睏仔久，kā蠓罩放--落-來，hiàm我入去睏，講beh pûn油燈仔火hōo hua，tsiah bē siunn討債。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">真正bē慣勢hiah早就peh去睏，就講siunn早睏bē ka-tsuē，beh去門口埕行行--leh；阿媽m̄肯，好喙ān講明仔載beh tshuā我去掠蝦仔，我tsiah無koh huan--落-去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隔工中晝，tsiah食飽煞，阿媽穿草鞋、戴笠仔，tshuân pùn-ki、揹魚khah仔，手牽我tsîng後壁溝liâu過溪，巡田岸仔路行差不多有一下仔久，uat落來溪墘；阿媽先tháu笠仔、魚khah仔囥tī沙埔，雙手phâng pùn-ki，勻勻仔tī水底徙跤，行到水草仔tsa̍t-tsa̍t ê對面溪邊，恬恬停落來揀一tah好所在thang落手掠蝦仔。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人小可仔ànn低，ná徙跤ná kā pùn-ki勻勻仔sak進前，雄雄tshè力kā hôo--起-來……；溪水thàng過bi̍h仔縫huā-huā叫一直流，活跳跳、金sih-sih ê蝦仔，khê tī pùn-ki仔底lìng起lìng落；笑bi-bi ê阿媽翻頭行起來沙埔，好禮仔kā倒入去魚khah仔；第二回伊koh換去別tah ê水草仔，仝款án-ne hôo，來來去去有十外kái，逐kái lóng有收成。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">手kuānn魚khah仔坐tī石頭鼓頂，斟酌看內底ê蝦仔，有大隻暗青殼，中大仔烏tòo紅，上細--ê親像石鉎hit色ê草蝦、溪蝦，濟kah ē驚--人，規陣tshàng鬚koh giàng牙peh-tsiūnn-peh落，e過來tsìnn過去無閒tshih-tshah，愈弄愈好sńg；無張無持阿媽huah講天beh烏--ah，好tńg--來-去，ná khîng家私beh走ê時tsūn，雷公sih-nah挵挵tân，西北雨拍tī樹葉仔sà-sà叫，tuì遠到近愈來愈響，兩媽孫仔有笠仔無棕簑，mā走bē赴thang bih雨，就據在伊lâm，沃無偌久，泅kah規身軀tâm-lok-lok，tsiah到厝；好佳哉頭鬃iáu ta-ta，魚khah仔kap蝦仔tsiâu原在，就趕緊落去洗身軀、換衫，lóng無去拍寒--著。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/eO0r8m\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/eO0r8m</a>）</span></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9EFbcrQ0KiLgwa2M3eDFyBMb8onr0DzxmjrPbABstYbNb5WCsa5bTjFCfge6Y8sKaJuefDwv5G7LkeqJMDyJdbtmLLHD1XaPQwzWrLCwmYeW1vit5lAz4Tlw8bdA3FNykykQPQwZ0HeRZLmhobsG7mjMpOU6qVDcnHWa8jenw7OQMnDjY3mTVCo0SXA/s1424/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9EFbcrQ0KiLgwa2M3eDFyBMb8onr0DzxmjrPbABstYbNb5WCsa5bTjFCfge6Y8sKaJuefDwv5G7LkeqJMDyJdbtmLLHD1XaPQwzWrLCwmYeW1vit5lAz4Tlw8bdA3FNykykQPQwZ0HeRZLmhobsG7mjMpOU6qVDcnHWa8jenw7OQMnDjY3mTVCo0SXA/w450-h640/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjTdu85Imyn8Q88ItnpTBQ-zabChgpc74Bw2Cxx0Fk8P5DtATh9XIqE77quq1rXnJFzn1GE2s8P2lbGHdRLX6Re8hgXjOBkoL4QY95jr8ZvMuM3INNQzeWD5FFfhHHwhnh1fxnFB6R3wdsMYH7k-EpFuAgd5uj69Bf2Sb8puicFjgwzlSGK7lukhOV-eA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_05.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-origi